{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01UM:title", "parent_tag": "01UM", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "risk_level": "R1", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Sheaf of differentials of a morphism", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-sheaf-differentials}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:273574afb9de1fc6c358fd3d4669df61e79ded9554b2c62e341bbad33094a5dc", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1a66902b886f8d1a44892d905a88e3623e35a315930ab17166be199dbd776621", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01UM:prose-0001", "parent_tag": "01UM", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "risk_level": "R2", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe suggest the reader take a look at the corresponding section\nin the chapter on commutative algebra\n(Algebra, Section <REF_0001>)\nand the corresponding section in the chapter on sheaves of modules\n(Modules, Section <REF_0002>).\n\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-section-differentials}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{modules-section-differentials}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:379416a7e06087373c302cdea513746492fc70321a10648439da1d55edfc851d", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:157cc86dbf89ac09372305a4da39a6d07e80cc04bab3a115bddcd5b0f65f91f6", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01UQ:statement", "parent_tag": "01UM", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThe <TEXTITOPEN_0001>sheaf of differentials <MATH_0002> of <MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is\nthe sheaf of differentials of <MATH_0005> viewed as a morphism of ringed spaces\n(Modules, Definition <REF_0001>)\nequipped with its <TEXTITOPEN_0002>universal <MATH_0006>-derivation<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0007>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "MATH_0002": "$\\Omega_{X/S}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-definition-differentials}", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\text{d}_{X/S} : \\mathcal{O}_X \\longrightarrow \\Omega_{X/S}.\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-sheaf-differentials}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:a04698d002e29789dc5f772fc0a42e3dc88a5fb505dfa0b71bc478ba19a079ff", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:70f96b6285ec38956f95709c0b0acbfee98a5ad124375116787b28e4ce87c3dd", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ec47ebf7814c1df17bb469aed4acb481c7c3ae51dabb5c57ef44e95662476fd3"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01UM:prose-0002", "parent_tag": "01UM", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "risk_level": "R2", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIt turns out that <MATH_0001> is a quasi-coherent <MATH_0002>-module\nfor example as it is isomorphic to the conormal sheaf\nof the diagonal morphism <MATH_0003>\n(Lemma <REF_0001>).\nWe have defined the module of differentials of <MATH_0004> over <MATH_0005> using a\nuniversal property, namely as the receptacle of the universal derivation.\nIf you have any other construction of the sheaf of relative differentials\nwhich satisfies this universal property then, by the Yoneda lemma,\nit will be canonically isomorphic to the one defined above. For convenience\nwe restate the universal property here.\n\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "MATH_0001": "$\\Omega_{X/S}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Delta : X \\to X \\times_S X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-differentials-diagonal}", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:8f5180e3bb1cd353d9168bd161d46b6977d4056bd3dfa3cb41e552f48830d2b5", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:38ce1c1e2fdf5655f244be08452ab365276a44f5d64f19ab059d8bedcff4edca", "source_math_hash": "sha256:054d1c31a0c19bde753373ff4e2c17a49efa6df2ef55b39a34bf8d7807f38e7e"}
